<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>{{ page_title }} — Microbiome Report</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-bg: #f1f5f9;
      --color-surface: #ffffff;
      --color-text: #0f172a;
      --color-muted: #64748b;
      --color-border: #e2e8f0;
      --color-accent: #3b82f6;
      --color-accent-dark: #1d4ed8;
      --color-accent-light: #eff6ff;
      --color-header-bg: #f8fafc;
      --color-nav: #1e293b;
      --color-nav-text: #f8fafc;
      --radius: 8px;
      --shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06), 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--color-bg);
      color: var(--color-text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding-top: 56px;
    }

    {# === Navbar (screen only) === #}
    .navbar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 56px;
      background: var(--color-nav);
      color: var(--color-nav-text);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 24px;
      z-index: 1000;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    .navbar .brand {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .navbar .brand span {
      opacity: 0.6;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-left: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .navbar nav {
      margin-left: auto;
      display: flex;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .navbar nav a {
      color: var(--color-nav-text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      opacity: 0.75;
      transition: opacity 0.15s, background 0.15s;
    }

    .navbar nav a:hover {
      opacity: 1;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    {# === Page wrapper for screen display === #}
    .page-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    {# === Each page article === #}
    article.page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 210mm;
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 20mm;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 257mm; /* A4 height (297mm) minus top+bottom margins (20mm each) */
    }

    {# === Cover page === #}
    .cover-content {
      min-height: 200mm;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cover-content h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    }

    .cover-content .cover-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .cover-meta {
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .cover-meta strong {
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .cover-stats {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .cover-stats .stat-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cover-stats .stat-value {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    }

    .cover-stats .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    {# === Section === #}
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    {# === Simple tables (data + info) === #}
    table.data-table,
    table.info-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    table.data-table th,
    table.data-table td,
    table.info-table th,
    table.info-table td {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    table.data-table thead th,
    table.info-table thead th {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    table.info-table td:first-child {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      width: 40%;
    }

    table.data-table td:first-child {
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    {# === Description text === #}
    .description-text {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .description-text p + p {
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    {# === Sankey === #}
    .sankey-container {
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 500px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--color-header-bg);
    }

    {# === Stats Grid (for diversity on page 3) === #}
    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: var(--color-header-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-card .stat-value {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-accent-dark);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .stat-card .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    {# === Appendix === #}
    .appendix-section {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .appendix-section h3 {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    }

    .appendix-section p,
    .appendix-section li {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .appendix-section ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .appendix-section li {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .citation-block {
      background: var(--color-header-bg);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .disclaimer-box {
      background: #fef9c3;
      border: 1px solid #fbbf24;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px 20px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #78350f;
    }

    {# === Page number + footer === #}
    .page-footer {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    {# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       PDF / Print — this is the key fix for page splitting
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 20mm;

      @bottom-center {
        content: "Generated by Hoshi · 16S rRNA Sequencing Report";
        font-size: 7pt;
        color: #64748b;
      }

      @bottom-right {
        content: "Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);
        font-size: 7pt;
        color: #64748b;
      }
    }

    @media print {
      body {
        padding-top: 0;
        background: #fff;
      }
      .navbar {
        display: none;
      }
      .page-wrapper {
        padding: 0;
        display: block;
      }
      article.page {
        box-shadow: none;
        border-radius: 0;
        max-width: none;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        min-height: auto;
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        page-break-after: always;
        break-after: page;
      }
      article.page:last-child {
        page-break-after: auto;
        break-after: auto;
      }
      .page-footer {
        display: none; /* Use @page margin boxes instead */
      }
    }

    {# WeasyPrint uses these directly (not inside @media print) #}
    article.page {
      page-break-after: always;
      break-after: page;
    }
    article.page:last-child {
      page-break-after: auto;
      break-after: auto;
    }
  </style>
  <script src="https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-latest.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

  {# === Navbar (hidden in PDF) === #}
  <div class="navbar">
    <div class="brand">Hoshi<span>16S Microbiome Report</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#page-cover">Cover</a>
      <a href="#page-raw">Raw Sequences</a>
      <a href="#page-species">Species</a>
      <a href="#page-sankey">Taxonomy</a>
      <a href="#page-appendix">Appendix</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="page-wrapper">

    {# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       PAGE 1 — Cover
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    <article class="page" id="page-cover">
      <div class="cover-content">
        <h1>{{ page_title }}</h1>
        <p class="cover-subtitle">16S rRNA Microbiome Profiling Report</p>

        <div class="cover-stats">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">{{ "{:,}".format(stats.total_reads) }}</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Total Reads</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">{{ stats.species_richness }}</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Species (S)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">{{ stats.shannon_index }}</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Shannon (H')</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cover-meta">
          <strong>Sample:</strong> {{ table.name }}<br>
          {% if table.sample_dir %}
          <strong>Source:</strong> {{ table.sample_dir }}<br>
          {% endif %}
          <strong>Generated:</strong> {{ report_date }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-footer">
        <span>Generated by Hoshi · 16S rRNA Sequencing Report</span>
        <span>Page 1 of 5</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    {# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       PAGE 2 — Raw Sequences Information
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    <article class="page" id="page-raw">

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Raw Sequences Information</h2>
        </div>

        <table class="info-table">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Total Reads</td>
              <td>{{ "{:,}".format(stats.total_reads) }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Classified Reads</td>
              <td>{{ "{:,}".format(stats.classified_reads) }} ({{ "%.1f"|format(stats.classified_reads / stats.total_reads * 100 if stats.total_reads > 0 else 0) }}%)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Unclassified Reads</td>
              <td>{{ "{:,}".format(stats.unclassified_reads) }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Classification Tool</td>
              <td>EMU (16S rRNA)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Reference Database</td>
              <td>NCBI RefSeq (EMU default)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Methods &amp; Pipeline</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="description-text">
          <p>
            Genomic DNA was extracted from the sample and the 16S rRNA gene region was
            amplified using standard primers targeting the V3–V4 hypervariable region.
            Sequencing was performed on a nanopore-based platform generating long-read
            amplicon data. Raw reads were quality-filtered and trimmed prior to taxonomic
            classification.
          </p>
          <p>
            Taxonomic profiling was performed using EMU (Exact Mapping of Unmapped reads),
            which utilizes an expectation-maximization algorithm to assign full-length 16S
            rRNA reads to species-level taxonomy. The reference database used is the EMU
            default database derived from NCBI RefSeq.
          </p>
          <p>
            Diversity indices (Shannon H', Simpson 1−D, Pielou's evenness) were computed
            from the classified species-level abundance profile. Relative abundance
            represents the proportion of classified reads assigned to each taxon.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-footer">
        <span>Generated by Hoshi · 16S rRNA Sequencing Report</span>
        <span>Page 2 of 5</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    {# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       PAGE 3 — Species Abundance Table
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    <article class="page" id="page-species">

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Species Abundance</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-label">Top species ranked by relative abundance</p>
        <div class="table-container">
          {{ table.top10_html | safe }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Diversity Summary</h2>
        </div>
        <table class="info-table">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Species Richness (S)</td>
              <td>{{ stats.species_richness }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Shannon Index (H')</td>
              <td>{{ stats.shannon_index }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Simpson Index (1−D)</td>
              <td>{{ stats.simpson_index }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Evenness (J)</td>
              <td>{{ stats.evenness }}</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="page-footer">
        <span>Generated by Hoshi · 16S rRNA Sequencing Report</span>
        <span>Page 3 of 5</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    {# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       PAGE 4 — Taxonomy Flow (Sankey Diagram)
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    <article class="page" id="page-sankey">

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Taxonomic Flow</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-label">Phylum → Class → Order → Family → Genus → Species</p>
        <div class="sankey-container">
          {% if table.sankey_svg %}
          {{ table.sankey_svg | safe }}
          {% else %}
          {{ table.sankey_html | safe }}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-footer">
        <span>Generated by Hoshi · 16S rRNA Sequencing Report</span>
        <span>Page 4 of 5</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    {# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       PAGE 5 — Appendix / Citations / Disclaimer
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    <article class="page" id="page-appendix">

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Appendix</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="appendix-section">
        <h3>Citations</h3>
        <p>If you use this report or the EMU tool in your research, please cite:</p>
        <div class="citation-block">
          Curry KD, Wang Q, Nute MG, et al. "Emu: species-level microbial community
          profiling of full-length 16S rRNA Oxford Nanopore sequencing data."
          <em>Nature Methods</em>, 19, 845–853 (2022).
          https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-022-01520-4
        </div>
        <div class="citation-block" style="margin-top: 8px;">
          Shannon CE. "A mathematical theory of communication."
          <em>Bell System Technical Journal</em>, 27(3), 379–423 (1948).
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="appendix-section">
        <h3>Software &amp; Databases</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>EMU</strong> — Species-level 16S rRNA profiling via expectation-maximization</li>
          <li><strong>Hoshi</strong> — Report generation and visualization pipeline</li>
          <li><strong>NCBI RefSeq</strong> — Reference database for taxonomic classification</li>
          <li><strong>Plotly</strong> — Interactive Sankey diagram rendering</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="appendix-section">
        <h3>Glossary</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Shannon Index (H')</strong> — Measures species diversity accounting for both richness and evenness.</li>
          <li><strong>Simpson Index (1−D)</strong> — Probability that two randomly chosen reads belong to different species.</li>
          <li><strong>Pielou's Evenness (J)</strong> — How evenly species abundances are distributed. 1.0 = perfectly even.</li>
          <li><strong>Species Richness (S)</strong> — Total number of distinct species detected.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="appendix-section">
        <h3>Disclaimer</h3>
        <div class="disclaimer-box">
          This report is generated for research purposes only and is not intended for
          clinical diagnosis or treatment decisions. The taxonomic assignments are based
          on computational algorithms and reference databases that may contain errors or
          incomplete coverage. Results should be interpreted in conjunction with
          appropriate controls and validated by independent methods when used for
          critical applications.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-footer">
        <span>Generated by Hoshi · 16S rRNA Sequencing Report</span>
        <span>Page 5 of 5</span>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
